Z||000003||Standard||02-08-2000||01:12 AM||||yep, I love it!  It's freakin' loud, tho.  Set off 2 car alarms so far.  I love it.<BR>My other car was an 84 SC.. the difference is unbelievable.||||reg||14
Z||000004||87GTBro||02-08-2000||11:20 AM||||$1100 is not bad at all.  I bought an 86.5 GT last December for 1750.  I wish I had a digital camera so I could post pics.  It is red.  It has sun-damaged quarter-windows so it doesn't look as good as these.  I can't afford new ones right now.<P>Standard,  have you thought about adding a spoiler on your GT?  I think it looks better with a spoiler.  Anyhow, congratulations!<P>Time to go wash and wax my baby!||||reg||1
Z||000005||Standard||02-09-2000||12:29 AM||||Thanks, 87!<BR>The quarter windows aren't the best on my car.  Drivers side is cracked in the front top corner, and pass. side has some spiderwebs.  Think I'm gonna get some Fieroheaven quarters.  <BR>There used to be a wing on it, but it was stolen the easy way.  I need a new decklid 'cause it doesn't sit straight anymore.  <BR>IMHO, I think a wing kind of interupts the lines of a Fastback.  I think it kind of goes more with the "muscular" look of a notchback with ground effects, 85 GT or 86 SE.  <BR>Can't wait till it gets warmer up here so I can spend all day making my car perfect!!||||reg||1
Z||000006||Shiner||02-09-2000||03:05 AM||||Congrats on the car!  She looks beautiful!<BR>I did the exact same thing, upgraded from an '84 SC to an '87 GT 5speed.  I gave me a whole new love of the fiero.  I really wish I could take my cat out, but those damn smog tests....  The nick us for about $50 here in Bucks county, PA.  Plus $16 for inspection.  And you have to let some ****  get in your car and drive it..... *shudder*<P>I am glad you are happy with the GT!  Have fun!||||reg||1
Z||000007||Standard||02-10-2000||12:42 AM||||I'm so glad MN got rid of the tests.. last year my 84 nearly overheated 'cause the line was so freakin' long.  Didn't have to get on the rollers, tho.  after I was done the inspection lady hands me the sheet and says "one of the few, one of the proud, pontiacs that pass.."   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||1
